a few points of comparison between the two movies:

total # of punches thrown by cruise: part i = a couple, part ii = too numerous to count;

total times cruise fires a gun: part i = zero, part ii = 50 gazillion;

total number of explosions: part i = two, part ii = 25 gazillion

